            "sid": "NEH 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku ya ishirini na nne ya mwezi huo wa saba, watu wa Israeli walikusanyika, wakifunga na kuvaa mavazi ya magunia na kujipaka udongo kichwani kuonesha majuto yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati huo, walikuwa wamejitenga mbali na watu wa mataifa mengine, wakasimama na kuungama dhambi zao na maovu ya babu zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa muda wa kama masaa matatu, walisimama huku sheria ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wao, inasomwa. Na kwa masaa matatu yaliyofuata, walikuwa wakitubu na kumwabudu Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
